"%1$sGravity Forms%3$s is required to use Gravity PDF. %2$sGet more "
"information%3$s."
msgstr ""
"%1$sGravity Forms%3$s is vereist om Gravity PDF te gebruiken. %2$sMeer "
"informatie%3$s."

